# Milestone and dev-log style

- **`docs/milestones.md`** — delivery order and status; not a substitute for reading code.
- **`docs/dev-log.md`** — dated notes; optional background.

Do not embed long specifications here; link to code paths or OpenAPI when precision is needed.
